sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Browser
    participant Nginx
    participant Frontend as Next.js Frontend
    participant Backend as Django REST API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>Browser: Opens application
    Browser->>Nginx: GET /
    Nginx->>Frontend: Proxy frontend request
    Frontend-->>Nginx: HTML / JS response
    Nginx-->>Browser: Application page

    Browser->>Nginx: API request /api/...
    Nginx->>Backend: Proxy API request
    Backend->>DB: Read or write data
    DB-->>Backend: Query result
    Backend-->>Nginx: JSON response
    Nginx-->>Browser: JSON response
